{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jliu67/OpenRX/pulls/68","id":4851152205,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVARvZM8AAAABISa1TQ","html_url":"https://github.com/jliu67/OpenRX/pull/68","diff_url":"https://github.com/jliu67/OpenRX/pull/68.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/jliu67/OpenRX/pull/68.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jliu67/OpenRX/issues/68","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jliu67/OpenRX/pulls/68/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jliu67/OpenRX/pulls/68/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jliu67/OpenRX/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jliu67/OpenRX/issues/68/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jliu67/OpenRX/statuses/a4bab722b745ef02c189fbc15be448ad189f19fb","number":68,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Finalize actual scratchpad with native AES and BLAKE2b-256","user":{"login":"jliu67","id":166252253,"node_id":"U_kgDOCejO3Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166252253?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliu67","html_url":"https://github.com/jliu67","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliu67/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliu67/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliu67/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliu67/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliu67/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliu67/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliu67/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliu67/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliu67/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Actual scratchpad bytes now feed a shared native AES-round scanner. The finalizer replaces all 64 A bytes and computes independently parameterized BLAKE2b-256 over captured little-endian R/F/E/A, preserving R/F/E/rounding. Read/length errors return original A with a zero digest. Execution, the `(v & 60)==0` gate, address recurrence, accepted sources and licensed IP remain unchanged.\n\nThis separate draft stacks on validated/frozen PR65 at `4f095fc147b5bc78de79746a0a172f38e34d6450`. Its 33-bit read tag combines 16 generation bits with 17 monotonic beat bits. The caller must provide exclusive quiescent memory and avoid generation reuse while late responses remain possible.\n\nLocal validation passes 41 RTL / 19 mapped modes, all 14 unchanged-native/Python cases, four balanced full 2 MiB trials, six malformed-native guards and four invalid hardware elaborations. Every full trial performs 131,072 exact reads; ideal/stalled primary latency is 393,284 / 1,048,649 modeled clocks. Complete bounded 256-byte mapped tests pass; default mapped cancellation/error tests use partial restarts and do not complete a full mapped hash. Yosys 0.9 actual mapping:\n\n| Component | Scratchpad bytes | Generic cells | Flop cells | Latch cells |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| scanner-default | 2,097,152 | 41,321 | 1,195 | 0 |\n| finalizer-default | 2,097,152 | 100,485 | 8,958 | 1,024 |\n| finalizer-bounded256 | 256 | 100,497 | 8,958 | 1,024 |\n\nOne admitted serial worker used verified CPU600%, RAM4GiB, swap512MiB, Tasks128, six-CPU affinity, a fresh OS reserve and the global lock; measured cgroup peak 1,902,161,920 bytes. All original source/output bytes, modes, licenses and failed preparation evidence are retained. [Design](https://github.com/jliu67/OpenRX/blob/feature/native-scratchpad-finalization/rtl/hash/FINALIZATION.md), [evidence](https://github.com/jliu67/OpenRX/blob/feature/native-scratchpad-finalization/docs/validation/scratchpad-finalization-20261013/README.md) and EXP-012 separate exact local execution from declared metadata/CI successor corrections. Eleven focused successor tests pass; all scientific RTL/native/oracle/fixture/bench and command construction remain exact. Hosted full validation of this published driver and new independent exact-head review remain required.\n\nFull initial scratchpad fill, AES program generation, actual dataset, complete hardware hash integration, selected core and physical/calibrated PPA remain open. No full program-chain rerun or merge is requested. PR65's public review remains unpublished. Relevant current-status/reproduction notes and connected CI dependency triggers are aligned.\n\nRelates to #67.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-14T00:18:33Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T13:53:14Z","closed_at":"2026-10-14T13:53:14Z","merged_at":"2026-10-14T13:53:14Z","merge_commit_sha":"5f28dd4363504ecf33a8f10451c53405773c564f","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"jliu67:feature/native-scratchpad-finalization","ref":"feature/native-scratchpad-finalization","repo":{"id":1409576804,"node_id":"R_kgDOVARvZA","name":"OpenRX","full_name":"jliu67/OpenRX","owner":{"login":"jliu67","id":166252253,"node_id":"U_kgDOCejO3Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166252253?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliu67","html_url":"https://github.com/jliu67","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliu67/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliu67/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliu67/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliu67/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliu67/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliu67/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliu67/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliu67/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jliu67/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived"